  "details": "# Issue\n\n—\n\nBetween uploads, networking may become broken in worlds. Common behaviour includes:\n\n- VRCObjectSync freezing objects in place, on drop, when initially marked as kinematic, even when kinematic has been disabled (kinematic state being reset?)\n\n- VRCObjectSync object interpolating/jumping rapidly between its last known location and spawn location on object respawn.\n\n- Networked variables improperly or failing to sync.\n\n- VRC Unity Video Players failing to load/sync video with owner.\n\n- VRC Unity Video Players failing entirely when ownership is transfered\n\nIssues have occurred in multiple worlds with multiple people, frequently in worlds which have been recently updated.\n\n—\n\n# Known Workarounds\n\n*(Inconsistent)*\n\n—\n\n- Delete all network ID listings in the VRC Scene Descriptor, then reupload for all relevant platforms.\n\n- Delete Quest build (if relevant) on <vrchat.com>, then follow steps in first workaround.",
